    "updated_at": "2025-11-06T11:24:22Z",
    "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#initialise-the-document-object is normatively called from:\r\n- https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#read-html:initialise-the-document-object\r\n  - For about:blank documents, the scripts would run before html/head/body exist. But when creating a child navigable, scripts run after those elements are inserted. Intentional?\r\n- https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#read-xml:initialise-the-document-object\r\n- https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#read-text:initialise-the-document-object\r\n- https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#read-media:initialise-the-document-object\r\n- https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#read-ua-inline:initialise-the-document-object\r\n  - This is intended to not be web-exposed, but would run WebDriver BiDi scripts. Is this OK?\r\n\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/#creating-a-new-browsing-context is normatively called from\r\n- https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#child-navigables:creating-a-new-browsing-context\r\n  - This would run scripts before the navigable is created.\r\n- https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#creating-browsing-contexts:creating-a-new-browsing-context\r\n  - This would run scripts before the browsing context is appended to a group and its properties are set.\r\n- https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#groupings-of-browsing-contexts:creating-a-new-browsing-context\r\n  - Similarly, would run scripts before the browsing context is appended to a group.\r\n\r\nInterestingly, https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#initialise-the-document-object step 1 calls https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#obtain-browsing-context-navigation which, if *swapGroup* is true, will run https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#creating-a-new-top-level-browsing-context which eventually calls https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#creating-a-new-browsing-context , creating a `Document` and running the WebDriver BiDi scripts. Then the https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#initialise-the-document-object algorithm discards that `Document` object and creates a new one, and runs the WebDriver BiDi scripts for this document, too.\r\n\r\nI suspect we don't want to run scripts for `Documents` that are discarded in a browsing context group switch?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
